  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Lion’s Blade Task Force",
    "summary": "Your **DEATHWING** units' **Charge roll** is 2 higher for a charge whose targets include a unit within **Engagement Range** of any of your **RAVENWING** units.\n\nEnemy units that Fall Back from Engagement Range of your **RAVENWING** units have every model take a **Desperate Escape** test, with -1 to each test if the unit is **Battle-shocked**; **MONSTERS** and **VEHICLES** are exempt.",
    "citations": [
      {
